WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.790
We are King Gnu. Thank you for having us.

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.230
Thank you.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.120
Please introduce yourselves.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:20.370
How did your band form? 
What are the origins of your band name?

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.760
I'm bassist Kazuki Arai. Thanks for having me.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.000
I'm Tsuneta.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.840
I'm drummer Yu Seki.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.990
I'm keyboardist Iguchi.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:43.820
Originally it was a two-man group with Daiki.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.440
Strictly speaking, 
there was something before that,

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.900
but this four-man group started there,

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:59.700
and the two of us on the left joined later.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:06.960
I joined through drummer Yu,

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:11.250
and Satoru is Daiki's childhood friend.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.930
That's roughly how the band formed.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.780
The band was originally called something else,

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:25.430
but we decided to change our name 
when we debuted and became King Gnu.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.750
There's an animal called the gnu.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.480
Tsuneta came up with the idea.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:36.110
The "gnu" symbolizes herd animals,

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:42.700
and "king" represents 
the leader who guides them.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:47.290
