artists from Igor Stravinsky

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.800
to Jimi Hendrix as your influences.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.030
Have you been influenced by 
more artists since then?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.400
Yes, on a regular basis.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:03.720
It changes all the time.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.310
Whoever's hot at the time.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:07.330
