I kind of think the oboe is cool.

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:41.290
You seem like an oboist.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.140
I'd like to.

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:45.560
I really like it.

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.710
It's great. I like the sound.

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:48.780
It's good.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.970
Oboe, then?

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.090
All of us?

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:52.840
Everyone?

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:54.250
So we're all choosing oboe?

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:55.420
We're all choosing oboe.
So we're all choosing oboe?

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:57.290
We're all choosing oboe.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:08.680
It's time for the Most Likely To Game.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:14.710
Who's most likely to win an Oscar?

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.020
Ready, and...

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.440
It's split two-two.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.560
It's two-two.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.220
I think it's me.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.080
Yu, then.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:31.570
I'd like to see him in a weird role.

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:33.580
Like Gollum.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.210
That's a supporting role.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.220
And not a leading role?

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.390
But he has such strong presence.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:40.160
So you weren't imagining him in a leading role.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.720
He's vital to the movie.
So you weren't imagining him in a leading role.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.920
He's vital to the movie.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.860
So I'd win Best Supporting Actor.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:48.390
Yeah.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:54.340
Who seems most likely to eat 
one of Sukuna's fingers?

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:59.720
What is this? What kind of question 
is this? Who wrote this?

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:03.510
Let's try it. Who's most likely to eat one?

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.690
Ready, and...

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:07.550
What?

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:08.880
It's Yu.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.880
No way.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.260
There's something going on here.
I chose Satoru.

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:13.700
There's something going on here.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.660
You only picked me because I like to eat.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.480
You think I'll eat anything.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:19.370
He'd probably eat it if you passed it to him.
You think I'll eat anything.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.560
He'd probably eat it if you passed it to him.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:22.500
Like along with some food.

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:25.610
Who's funniest or most interesting?

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:29.050
Suddenly a deep question.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.960
What makes a person interesting?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.660
We're all interesting in our own ways.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.440
Ready, and—

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:37.890
Wait. I haven't chosen yet.

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:41.200
I don't think I can choose.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.410
I can't choose.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:47.020
I can't answer this one. I can't choose.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.820
I thought it might be Satoru, but...

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.470
The obvious answer is Satoru.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.080
Publicly, yeah.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.250
Publicly?

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:59.320
But he's not nearly as interesting at home.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.500
I'm really boring. For real.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.410
He's really boring at home.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.500
All I do is talk to my cat.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.520
Like, "What is it, kitty?"

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:12.260
Who would be first to die in a horror movie?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.070
If the four of us were in a horror movie.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:19.260
In other words, who seems 
most like a minor character.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.990
It's probably me.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.560
Really?

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.000
I don't really think so.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:30.470
You seem like you'd be one of the final three.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.280
It's always someone interesting.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.830
Suppose there're three people left,

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:40.700
and someone has to die 
for the group to progress.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:41.790
Right, that trope.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.670
Who would die then?

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.540
Ugh, that's the worst.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:51.260
I'll do it.

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:52.860
Man, that's not fair.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:56.060
Don't volunteer. That's not fair.

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:57.160
You're volunteering?

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.530
Who's the best dancer?

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.810
Could you dance for us a little?

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.480
Well, this one is easy.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.040
Ready, and...

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:10.150
That was quick.

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:15.020
Okay. That's all for now.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.200
There were a lot of unusual questions,

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.950
but we hope you learned something about us.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.140
We were King Gnu.

